The engine is built on GateKit (the `gatekit` submodule, https://github.com/bg3gk/gatekit),
whose NOTICE lists the third-party components it uses, among them Norbyte's LSLib.

The databases this engine reads are published as release assets, never in this tree. The game's
content inside them is Larian Studios', and is withdrawn the same day it is asked for (README.md).
The component map and the facts about the engine's binaries are the GateKit project's own
research.
